<title>USA: CCC seeks 9,280 T cornmeal for Rwanda/Mali/Lesotho.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks 9,280 T cornmeal for Rwanda/Mali/Lesotho.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture (CCC) said it was tendering on March 10 to buy a total of 9,280 tonnes U.S. cornmeal for export to Rwanda, Mali and Lesotho.</p>
<p>The deal included 4,440 tonnes for Rwanda, 2,540 tonnes for Mali and 2,300 tonnes for Lesotho.</p>
<p>Shipping periods were slated for April 6-20 and April 20-May 5.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
</text>
